error[NK1331]: You're changing `items`, but it is `immutable`: nothing reachable from it ever changes.
  --> tests/immutable_is_not_changed_by_a_method.nika:5:2
   |
 4 | 	immutable items: Vec[i64] = [1, 2]
   |            ----- declared `immutable` here
 5 | 	items.push(3)
   |  ^^^^^ changed here, by `push`
   |
   = note: An `immutable` binding is read through views only, so neither the name nor any part of its value is changed (ADR-389).
   = help: Change a copy: `let mut items_own = items.clone()`, or bind it with `let mut` if it is meant to change.
